  "notes": "{縫|ぬ}う means to sew or stitch with needle and thread.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: ⟦ボタン→ボタン：02963_botan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{縫|ぬ}う\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{縫|ぬ}い{物|もの}→縫い物：20002_nuimono⟧: sewing, needlework\n- ⟦{縫|ぬ}い{目|め}→縫い目：07102_nuime⟧: seam, stitch\n- ⟦{縫|ぬ}い{付|つ}ける→縫い付ける：noentry⟧: to sew on\n- ⟦{手縫|てぬ}い→手縫い：noentry⟧: hand-sewn\n- ⟦ミシン→ミシン：06365_mishin⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{縫|ぬ}う: to sew with a sewing machine\n\nMETAPHORICAL USE:\n⟦{人混|ひとご}み→人混み：03709_hitogomi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{縫|ぬ}う (to weave through a crowd) - moving in a zigzag pattern like a needle through fabric.",
